ex.merge_timestamps","public":true,"source_order":5,"span":{"end_byte":3586,"end_column":1,"end_line":103,"start_byte":2218,"start_column":1,"start_line":75},"callable_kind":"sync","parameters":[{"default":null,"kind":"positional","name":"files","source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":2265,"end_column":48,"end_line":75,"start_byte":2238,"start_column":21,"start_line":75},"type":{"item":{"args":[],"kind":"named","name":"real.toolong.model.FileTimestamps"},"kind":"list"}},{"default":null,"kind":"positional","name":"complete","source_order":1,"span":{"end_byte":2281,"end_column":64,"end_line":75,"start_byte":2267,"start_column":50,"start_line":75},"type":{"kind":"primitive","name":"bool"}}],"return_type":{"args":[],"kind":"named","name":"real.toolong.model.MergedIndex"},"contract":{"clauses":[],"effects":[]},"body":null},{"annotations":[],"doc":{"span":{"end_byte":4711,"end_column":8,"end_line":122,"start_byte":3652,"start_column":5,"start_line":104},"text":"Toolong's index_to_span: where displayed line number line (zero-based)\nlives.\n\nSingle(file_index): the file is 0; with breaks b (length n), scan_start s\nand scanned_size z: when n is 0 the span is (s, s); otherwise let i be\nline clamped to at most n; i == 0 gives (s, b[0]); otherwise the span\nstarts at b[i - 1] and ends at b[i] when i < n, else at z - 1 (0 when z is\n0). Spans of lines after the first therefore start at the preceding LF.\n\nMerged(merged_index): when line < lines.len the file and the file's own\nline number come from lines[line]; otherwise the file is 0 and the file's\nown line number is line. The span is then computed exactly like Single\nusing that file's breaks (an empty list when the file has none), scan\nstart 0 and the merged scanned_size.\nThe index payloads are immutable tuples; unwrap and index them directly.\nDo not allocate copies of all breaks or merged lines per lookup: this\ncallable runs once for each visible row and each search candidate."},"generics":[],"kind":"function","name":"